<section id="theming">
  <div class="container inner">
    <div class="intro">
      <h2>It should look like your product, not ours.</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        You can ship the default UI as it is. If you'd rather not, restyle it with CSS or replace
        it with your own components.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Use the default</h3>
        <p>Import the theme and you get a toolbar, popovers, and light and dark modes.</p>
        <div class="stage" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="bar bar-default">
            <span class="cell cell-default"
              ><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 3l14 8-6 2-2 6z"></path></svg></span
            >
            <span class="cell cell-default on"
              ><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path d="M9 11l6-6 4 4-6 6H9v-4zM4 20h8"></path></svg
              ></span
            >
            <span class="cell cell-default"
              ><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 5h14v10H10l-5 4z"></path></svg></span
            >
            <span class="cell cell-default"
              ><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path d="M4 18c3-8 5 4 8-4s4 2 8-6"></path></svg
              ></span
            >
            <span class="cell cell-default"
              ><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><rect x="5" y="5" width="14" height="14" rx="2"></rect></svg
              ></span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
        <pre tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Code sample: Default theme import">import '@inkbar/theme/theme.css'</pre>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3>Restyle it with CSS</h3>
        <p>
          The theme's rules have zero specificity and sit in one cascade layer, so your CSS
          overrides them without <code>!important</code>. If your page defines tokens such as
          --primary and --radius, the theme uses them.
        </p>
        <div class="stage" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="bar bar-pill">
            <span class="cell cell-pill"
              ><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 3l14 8-6 2-2 6z"></path></svg></span
            >
            <span class="cell cell-pill on"
              ><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path d="M9 11l6-6 4 4-6 6H9v-4zM4 20h8"></path></svg
              ></span
            >
            <span class="cell cell-pill"
              ><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 5h14v10H10l-5 4z"></path></svg></span
            >
            <span class="cell cell-pill"
              ><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path d="M4 18c3-8 5 4 8-4s4 2 8-6"></path></svg
              ></span
            >
            <span class="cell cell-pill"
              ><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><rect x="5" y="5" width="14" height="14" rx="2"></rect></svg
              ></span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
        <pre tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Code sample: CSS override example">@layer inkbar, utilities;

:root &#123;
  --primary: #0d1026;
  --radius: 999px;
  --ink-highlight: #e4ff4a;
&#125;</pre>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3>Rebuild it in your design system</h3>
        <p>Leave out the default toolbar and wire your own buttons to the state it uses.</p>
        <div class="stage" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="bar bar-square">
            <span class="cell cell-square"
              ><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 3l14 8-6 2-2 6z"></path></svg></span
            >
            <span class="cell cell-square on"
              ><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path d="M9 11l6-6 4 4-6 6H9v-4zM4 20h8"></path></svg
              ></span
            >
            <span class="cell cell-square"
              ><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 5h14v10H10l-5 4z"></path></svg></span
            >
            <span class="cell cell-square"
              ><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path d="M4 18c3-8 5 4 8-4s4 2 8-6"></path></svg
              ></span
            >
            <span class="cell cell-square last"
              ><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><rect x="5" y="5" width="14" height="14" rx="2"></rect></svg
              ></span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
        <pre tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Code sample: Custom toolbar example">&lt;InkRoot src=&#123;src&#125; assets=&#123;assets&#125;&gt;
  &lt;YourToolbar /&gt;
  &lt;InkViewport /&gt;
&lt;/InkRoot&gt;</pre>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

